{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_02",
  "title": "拓荒者小屋",
  "storyCode": "DV-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "da7005886312f314659b19a81f307c56cbc96f6d7e0050f1bf63f2a009997a3a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的人生就再没有其他出路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "......先生？领队先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "您是不太舒服吗？我听到您的呼吸很急促。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "别怕，我没有恶意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "我是和赫默医生一起进来的，您的队员们都检查过了，我们没有携带危险的武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "抱歉。我只是出于习惯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "您没必要道歉。我能理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "逐渐蔓延的黑暗会让人情绪紧张。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "您要不要离我近一点？人多的地方会暖和一些，这样的话，就算忍不住睡过去了，也不至于会被冻僵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "其他人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "赫默医生的医疗无人机装配有应急电源。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "她正在屋子里为白面鸮小姐检查身体，埃琳娜小姐也和她们在一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "萨姆......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "他听从您的安排，把身体不太好的拓荒者们都集中到室内了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "我想拜托你一件事。不要告诉萨姆和其他人，我刚刚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "您是领队，在这个节骨眼上，要是他们知道您体力不支，拓荒队内部可能会失控。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "我并不是想说拓荒队不够团结，只是......黑暗往往会催生变数。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......你很有经验。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "我是玻利瓦尔人。在我过去生活的那座城市里，停电是常有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "玻利瓦尔......战乱地区？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "在我的家乡，我们很难说清楚，战火会在哪里暂时停下脚步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "能从那个地方走出来，你很不容易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "是同事们帮助了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "在我看来，您和其他拓荒队的人更了不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "我......了不起？哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "您、您笑什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "原来那几家公司的广告已经一路打到玻利瓦尔去了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "不，我不是这个意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "无论如何，您靠自己的双腿走到了这里。而您的前辈们，那些来自维多利亚、高卢和玻利瓦尔的移民......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "是各位的足迹点亮了这片荒野。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "哈......你还很会说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "欸？我只是实话实说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "在来之前，我就一直想看看哥伦比亚大名鼎鼎的拓荒区是什么模样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "那你失望了吗？这里说不定比你的家乡还要荒凉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "不，领队先生，我还是学到了很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "比如说，你们的电源线路设计果然和Mechanist先生说得一样，简洁且有效率啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "text": "警长，载具准备好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "带上防具。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "我刚看见了，他们手上有自制手弩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "等天更黑一点，派几架无人机先靠近拓荒者居住区，确认人质和匪徒各自所在位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "我们跟在后面，找个好时机攻进去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "text": "那......赫默研究员和那个罗德岛的干员呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "你想说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "text": "我不确定他们站在哪一边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "......这是你们莱茵生命的做事方法吗？不管做什么事，都要先选边站？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "text": "我们只是想确保问题得到解决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "text": "警长，这就是防卫科的工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "那我的职责是救人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "听好，我不管你们想干什么，你们最好也不要妨碍我的工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "这么说，是罗德岛的人救了你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "罗德岛不仅仅救下了当时差点在事故中死去的我，还给了我继续学习的机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "我能成长为现在的我，全靠罗德岛改变了我的人生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "哈哈......真是一家不错的公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "要不是眼下这情形，我会以为这是什么招聘宣讲会现场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "......桑尼先生，要是您有这方面想法的话，真的可以向罗德岛投递简历。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "我，一个拓荒者，现在恐怕还成了绑架犯......向你描述中这么好的公司投递简历？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "别拿我开玩笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "你再怎么谦虚，我也能看出来，你是一个多么富有潜力的工程师。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "更别提你那三位同事......她们身为感染者，还能被莱茵生命雇佣，你知道这有多难吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "唔......她们的确很优秀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "不，不止是优秀。她们是万里挑一，在各自领域出类拔萃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "每年有那么多感染者，只有极少数天才能得到“赦免”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "可是罗德岛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "是啊，格雷伊先生，你想说，“罗德岛救人的时候并没有那么严苛的条件”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "就算我愿意相信你，相信你对救你一命的公司有特别的信心，相信它愿意违背自己追逐利益的天性，无差别地对待每一个感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "你还是无法否认，你也是那个被选中的幸运儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "剩下的倒霉蛋，要么被圈养起来等着泥水没过头顶，要么只能试着走几步，冒着陷得更快的风险，找下一块能暂时落脚的弹丸之地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "他们......都和我一样，没人救我们，就连我们自己也不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "奥利维亚，你觉得这真的管用？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "乔伊丝的脑电指标稳定一点了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我给她注射了一些神经抑制剂，这是过去的常规治疗手段。虽然这次效果不是特别理想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "难道她病发另有诱因？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "那她岂不是依然很危险？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "嗯，解决不了诱因的话，她需要更好的监护环境。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "正好......我本来也并不是在问乔伊丝的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "你让格雷伊和拓荒者领队一起巡线......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "不是我派他去的，格雷伊有自己的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "......你是队长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "我在罗德岛本舰待的时间没有你们长，可我知道罗德岛是怎么行动的。奥利维亚，我不是想指责你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "但要是格雷伊遭遇危险，或者乔伊丝的病情有所耽搁，你不会原谅你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "埃琳娜，你觉得那位桑尼先生更容易相信格雷伊，还是我们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "有差别吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我记得你是在一场莱茵总部的实验事故里不幸感染了矿石病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "当时你有想过......以后可能再也做不了研究吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "不过很快，老板——我是说斐尔迪南就给我发了新的合同，把三年续成了十年，顺便涨了百分之三十的薪水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "那一年你还是莱茵年度优秀员工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "唔......这不算安抚吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "再怎么说，我在罗德岛治病的那些日子里，还给主任写完了三篇顶会论文啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我理解你的想法，因为我也差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我远不及你乐观纯粹，我担忧过未来，也因此感激过帕尔维斯和莱茵生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "可我......我也从未怀疑过自己的天赋，以及我的天赋能带给莱茵生命的回报。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "矿石病对我们来说是必须要克服的挑战，它不会蚕食全部的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "而这就是为何......格雷伊能做到我们都做不到的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "桑尼先生，我想指出，您说的话里有一些互相冲突的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "有吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "您说你们拓荒者是在冒着风险找下一块落脚之地......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "那您怎么知道，往我们这边走一步，就不会是出路呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "领队，你看屋子里——供电恢复了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "怎么回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "等等，是你——你在跟我说话的同时，还在忙着做这个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "桑尼先生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "要是我当年没有跑进外面的黑暗里，就不可能遇上提着灯的罗德岛前辈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "请相信我，有时候，再走一步真的有用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "就算......我已经站在了悬崖边缘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "——哪怕您跳了下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "我们看到了您伸出来的手。您在向我们求救。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "那我们就会尽一切努力抓住您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "不管您遭遇了什么，都还远远没到放弃的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "通电了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "格雷伊......成功了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "太好了，乔伊丝对光亮有了反应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "不愧是你，直到此刻都这么专注。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......女士们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "为什么你一个人回来了？格雷伊呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "目前只有这一块区域通了电，他正在赶往另一片居住区。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "你不信任我，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "别过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "埃琳娜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "奥利维亚，你说他不会相信我们的话，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "我更没有理由相信他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "是他把我和乔伊丝骗到了这里，而且我一直没说......我看见他们派了更多人围住了实验区。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "那些拓荒者全都拿着武器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "事情不是你想的那样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "我想的是什么样？你说你不想忘恩负义，难道你忘了多萝西是怎么对你们的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "你们却为了一己私欲想要伤害她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "警报......你拉响了警报？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "我早就想这么做了。警察和防卫科的同事们一定已经在路上，这下他们不必出动无人机确定我们的方位了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "这还得多谢格雷伊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "他是故意帮我们恢复供电......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "别用你的阴暗心思揣测他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "格雷伊是真的想帮助你们，就跟多萝西和乔伊丝一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "看在他们的分上，我也会考虑再放你一马。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "领队，无论你们先前有什么打算，都趁早放弃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "......无人机已经出动了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "text": "还没有，我们的人在等您的指令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "text": "那......基地里那些会飞的发光点是什么玩意？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "差一点点，马上就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "这光......好、好美。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "很美吗？谢谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "哈哈......跟着您干了会活儿，连身体都更暖和了些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "接下来就只剩前面那个点了吧？让那些大公司的人见鬼去吧，只要我们的双手还能动，就休想用停止供给来威胁我们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "不对劲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "请等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "不，不要再往前走了，那个光点并不是我的法术！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......赫默医生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "我还想再问一次，你是不是真的愿意相信一名拓荒者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我是医生，也是研究员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我和我的同事们一样——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我们相信真相。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "外面怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "为什么有这么多人在跑动？是不是你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "不，我没有让他们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "混蛋，别过来啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "糟了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "可能是警察来救我们了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "不，别出去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "你又发什么疯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "我猜是那个东西又来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "text": "什么东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "是我本来想告诉你们的......真相。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "埃琳娜，离门远一些！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "领、领队......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
      "text": "我......小......心......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "他是不是受伤了？还是......发病？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "别靠近他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "你的队员很明显需要帮助！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "注意他身后——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "形状不规则的物体悬在半空中。\n它的表面非常光滑，散发着柔和的银色光芒，此刻正微微起伏着，就如同顺应着某种呼吸的节奏。\n从拓荒者背后爬起来之后，它在空中停顿了大约三秒。\n随后，它缓慢地转动起自己的身躯，仿佛正好奇地挨个打量在场的人类。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "这......这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "text": "快跑！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
